msgstr "Supporto pseudo-3D, compresa l'anteprima nell'editor."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:157
msgid ""
":ref:`2D lighting <doc_2d_lights_and_shadows>` with normal maps and specular "
"maps."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Illuminazione 2D <doc_2d_lights_and_shadows>` con mappe normal e "
