msgstr "|release| Driver per input da tavoletta grafica."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:119
msgid "``--headless``"
msgstr "``--headless``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:119
