#: ../../docs/tutorials/io/runtime_file_loading_and_saving.rst:311
msgid ""
"Additionally, it is possible to load any font that is installed on the "
"system using Godot's support for :ref:`doc_using_fonts_system_fonts`."
msgstr ""
"Inoltre, è possibile caricare qualsiasi font installato sul sistema "
"attraverso il supporto di Godot per :ref:`doc_using_fonts_system_fonts`."

