#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/ssl_certificates.rst:4
msgid "TLS/SSL certificates"
msgstr "Certificati SSL/TLS"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/ssl_certificates.rst:9
msgid ""
"It is often desired to use :abbr:`TLS (Transport Layer Security)` "
"connections (also known as :abbr:`SSL (Secure Sockets Layer)` connections) "
"for communications to avoid \"man in the middle\" attacks. Godot has a "
"connection wrapper, :ref:`StreamPeerTLS <class_StreamPeerTLS>`, which can "
"take a regular connection and add security around it. The :ref:`HTTPClient "
"<class_HTTPClient>` and :ref:`HTTPRequest <class_HTTPRequest>` classes also "
"support HTTPS using this same wrapper."
msgstr ""
"Spesso si preferisce usare connessioni :abbr:`TLS (Transport Layer "
"Security)` (note anche come connessioni :abbr:`SSL (Secure Sockets Layer)`) "
"per le comunicazioni, pur di evitare attacchi \"man in the middle\". Godot "
"dispone di un wrapper di connessione, :ref:`StreamPeerTLS "
"<class_StreamPeerTLS>`, che può accettare una connessione standard e "
"aggiungervi sicurezza. Anche le classi :ref:`HTTPClient <class_HTTPClient>` "
"e :ref:`HTTPRequest <class_HTTPRequest>` supportano HTTPS attraverso lo "
"stesso wrapper."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/ssl_certificates.rst:17
msgid ""
"Godot will try to use the TLS certificate bundle provided by the operating "
"system, but also includes the `TLS certificate bundle from Mozilla <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/thirdparty/certs/ca-"
"certificates.crt>`__ as a fallback."
msgstr ""
"Godot tenterà di utilizzare il pacchetto di certificati TLS fornito dal "
"sistema operativo, ma include anche il `pacchetto di certificati TLS di "
"Mozilla <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/thirdparty/certs/"
"ca-certificates.crt>`__ come alternativa di riserva."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/ssl_certificates.rst:22
msgid ""
"You can alternatively force your own certificate bundle in the Project "
"Settings:"
msgstr ""
"In alternativa, è possibile forzare il proprio pacchetto di certificati "
"nelle Impostazioni del progetto:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/ssl_certificates.rst:24
#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/ssl_certificates.rst:28
#, fuzzy
msgid "Setting the TLS certificate bundle override project setting"
msgstr ""
"Impostare la sostituzione del pacchetto di certificati TLS tramite "
"impostazioni del progetto"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/networking/ssl_certificates.rst:30
msgid ""
"When set, this file *overrides* the operating system provided bundle by "
"default. This file should contain any number of public certificates in `PEM "
"format <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Privacy-enhanced_Electronic_Mail>`__."
msgstr ""
