"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_dir>`."
msgstr ""
"Stringa rappresentante un percorso a una cartella. "
"Consultare :ref:`@export_dir <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_dir>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:120
msgid ""
"String as a path to a file, custom filter provided as hint. See "
"again :ref:`@export_file <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_file>`."
msgstr ""
"Stringa rappresentante un percorso a un file, filtro personalizzato fornito "
"come suggerimento. Consultare nuovamente :ref:`@export_file "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_file>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:126
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:198
msgid ""
"Using paths in the global filesystem is also possible, but only in scripts "
"in tool mode."
msgstr ""
"È possibile utilizzare anche i percorsi nel file system globale, ma solo "
"negli script in modalità strumento (tool)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:129
msgid ""
"String as a path to a PNG file in the global filesystem. "
