msgstr "MonoDevelop"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:74
msgid "Visual Studio for Mac"
msgstr "Visual Studio per Mac"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:77
msgid "See the following sections for how to configure an external editor:"
msgstr ""
"Per informazioni su come configurare un editor esterno, consultare le "
"sezioni seguenti:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:82
msgid ""
"After reading the \"Prerequisites\" section, you can download and install "
"`JetBrains Rider <https://www.jetbrains.com/rider/download>`__."
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver letto la sezione \"Prerequisiti\", scaricare e installare "
"`JetBrains Rider <https://www.jetbrains.com/rider/download>`__."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:85
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:100
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:169
