msgid ""
"Set **Dotnet** -> **Editor** -> **External Editor** to **JetBrains Rider**."
msgstr ""
"Impostare **Dotnet** -> **Editor** -> **Editor esterno** su **JetBrains "
"Rider**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:89
msgid "In Rider:"
msgstr "In Rider:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:91
msgid "Set **MSBuild version** to **.NET Core**."
msgstr "Imposta **MSBuild version** su **.NET Core**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:92
