"limitare i tipi chiave e valore a un :ref:`tipo compatibile con Variant "
"<c_sharp_variant_compatible_types>`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:200
msgid ""
"An untyped ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary`` can be converted to a typed "
"dictionary using the ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary<TKey, "
"TValue>(Godot.Collections.Dictionary)`` constructor."
msgstr ""
"Un ``Godot.Collections.Dictionary`` non tipizzato può essere convertito in "
"un dizionario tipizzato attraverso il costruttore "
"``Godot.Collections.Dictionary<TKey, TValue>(Godot.Collections.Dictionary)``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_collections.rst:205
