"modulo di binding per inizializzarle, ma potrebbe essere necessario "
"configurare altre cose a seconda delle esigenze. Chiamiamo la macro "
"``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` per ciascuna delle classi presenti nella nostra "
"libreria."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:272
msgid ""
"You can find information about ``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` (and alternatives) "
"at :ref:`doc_object_class`."
msgstr ""
"È possibile trovare informazioni su ``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` (e alternative) "
"in :ref:`doc_object_class`."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:274
msgid ""
"The important function is the third function called "
"``example_library_init``. We first call a function in our bindings library "
"that creates an initialization object. This object registers the "
"initialization and termination functions of the GDExtension. Furthermore, it "
