msgstr ""
"Visto che siamo qui, possiamo registrare la nostra nuova classe "
"personalizzata. Completiamo la funzione ``initialize_gdexample_module()``:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/gdextension/gdextension_c_example.rst:479
msgid ""
"The struct with the class information is the biggest thing here. None of its "
"fields are required with the exception of ``create_instance_func`` and "
"``free_instance_func``. We haven't made those functions yet, so we'll have "
