#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:15
msgid "From the Android Studio's welcome window select **Open**."
msgstr "Dalla finestra di benvenuto di Android Studio seleziona **Open**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:21
